# Rebranding & Car Content Removal Summary (Updated)

## ✅ Public Website Rebranding Complete

### 1. **Timeline Component** (`components/Timeline.js`)
**Updated:**
- Rewrote the company history from a car dealership to a professional video production agency.
- Foundation year updated to 2020 (Bangalore-based production).
- Milestone descriptions changed from showroom openings to studio expansions and project growth.
- Replaced car-specific image placeholders with more generic branding assets.

### 2. **About Component** (`components/About.js`)
**Updated:**
- Headline changed from "Crafting Car Dreams" to "Crafting Visual Stories".
- Founding year fixed to 2020.
- Background image set to agency branding.

### 3. **FAQ Page** (`app/FAQ/FAQPage.jsx`)
**Updated:**
- Completely replaced all 15+ car-selling/buying questions with production-related questions.
- Added FAQs about video services, timelines, pricing, and revision processes.

### 4. **SEO & Metadata** (`app/layout.js`, `app/page.js`)
**Updated:**
- Root layout title changed to "Lyf Ads - Video Production & Motion Systems Agency".
- Description updated to focus on high-end cinematography and brand storytelling.
